<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραιπᾰλ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be intoxicated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				298
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.33.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.260
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειρακίων τινῶν -ώντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					114
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>have a sick headache after a debauch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραιπαλῶν ἔτι ἐκ τῆς προτεραίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					176d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθὲς ὑπέπινες, εἶτα νυνὶ κραιπαλᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					286
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ τοῦ μεθύσκεσθαι πρότερον τὸ
					κραιπαλᾶν παρεγίγνεθ᾽ ἡμῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					255.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέξω Λέσβιον, Χῖον . . , ὥστε
					μηδένα κραιπαλᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philyll.
					24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>carouse, revel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				77.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.34
			</span></i>.</div>
